OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested  after body found in
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith the death of a 41-year-old whose
OL,8,Fbody was found on the ground floor of a
OL,9,Fmulti-storey car park.
OL,11,FDevon and Cornwall Police said the
OL,12,FTruro man's death was being treated as
OL,13,Funexplained and "significant inquiries
OL,14,Fremain ongoing to establish the
OL,15,Fcircumstances" after his body was found
OL,16,Fat  Moorfield Car Park in Truro,
OL,17,FCornwall at about 10:45 BST on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
