OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested  after body found in
OL,4,Acar park
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said they have arrested
OL,7,F44-year-old man from Truro on suspicion
OL,8,Fof assault grievous bodily harm,
OL,9,Fadministering a noxious substance and
OL,10,Ftheft.
OL,12,FHe remains in police custody.
